<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:26px;color:#1c1917;">Reset your password</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;">We received a request to reset the password for <strong><%= @resource.email %></strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;"><%= link_to "Choose a new password", edit_password_url(@resource, reset_password_token: @token), style: "display:inline-block;background:#e11d48;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:6px;" %></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#78716c;font-size:13px;">If you did not request this, ignore this email. Your password will stay unchanged.</p>
